\n   - NEVER create a line item for a Phone / Mobile / Contact Number.\\n   - Every valid item MUST represent a product or service with a genuine unit quantity and unit price. If a row lacks a product description or represents invoice metadata, ignore it from items.\\n\\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object matching this schema:\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
